{"sections":[{"slug":"Borel子代数","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Borel子代数"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Borel <span lang=\"zh\">子代数</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Borel 子代数”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Lie代数","text":"Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Borel <span lang=\"zh\">子代数是其极大</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/可解","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">可解</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">子代数</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">给定一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/根系","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">根系</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">以及正根的概念</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">可定义分解</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathfrak g=\\mathfrak n^-\\oplus\\mathfrak h\\oplus\\mathfrak n^+,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathfrak n^+ = \\sum_{\\alpha&gt;0}\\mathfrak g_{\\alpha}.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">此时</span> $\\mathfrak b=\\mathfrak h\\oplus\\mathfrak n^+$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> Borel <span lang=\"zh\">子代数</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>$\\mathfrak {gl}_n(\\mathbb{C})$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Borel <span lang=\"zh\">子代数</span> $\\mathfrak b$ <span lang=\"zh\">是上三角矩阵构成的子代数</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">有短正合列</span>\n$$\r\n0 \\to \\mathfrak n \\to \\mathfrak b \\to \\mathfrak h \\to 0.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">且其中</span> $\\mathfrak n = [\\mathfrak b,\\mathfrak b]$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Borel子群","text":"Borel <span lang=\"zh\">子群</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}